#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:1
msgid "常用参数配置"
msgstr "Common Parameter Settings"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:3
msgid "本页范围"
msgstr "Scope of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"使用{ref}`NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>`调整**输出频率**和当前固件支持的 "
"**NMEA / UBX 消息项**。完整功能可通过菜单栏 `Help` 查看官方使用说明。"
msgstr ""
"Use {ref}`NavStarTool <connect-navstartool>` to adjust **output frequency** "
"and the **NMEA / UBX message items** supported by the current firmware. Full "
"functionality can be viewed in the official user manual through the `Help` "
"menu."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:10
msgid ""
"修改前先记录当前配置 先确认目标平台和当前出厂输出，并使用 `Read from Chip` 读"
"取现有参数。选择原则见[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Before making modifications, first record the current configuration, confirm "
"the target platform and current factory output, and use `Read from Chip` to "
"read the existing parameters. See [Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol]"
"(../operation/firmware-output.md) for selection principles."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:13
msgid "读取接收机配置"
msgstr "Read receiver configuration"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:15
msgid "点击菜单栏："
msgstr "Click the menu bar:"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:21
msgid ""
"首次打开 `Receiver Settings` 窗口时，可能不会显示当前配置。此时需要点击界面中"
"的 `Read from Chip`，从设备读取现有参数。"
msgstr ""
"The `Receiver Settings` window may not show the current configuration when "
"first opened. Click `Read from Chip` to load the existing parameters from "
"the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:23
msgid "![Receiver Settings](../images/receiver-settings.png)"
msgstr "![Receiver Settings](../images/receiver-settings.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:23
msgid "Receiver Settings"
msgstr "Receiver Settings"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:25
msgid "设置输出频率"
msgstr "Set output frequency"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:27
msgid "以设置 NMEA 输出频率为 10 Hz 为例："
msgstr "Taking setting the NMEA output frequency to 10 Hz as an example:"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:29
msgid "在 `Receiver Settings` 中点击 `Read from Chip`。"
msgstr "Click 'Read from Chip' in 'Receiver Settings'."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:30
msgid "找到 `Receiver Parameters -> Working Rate`。"
msgstr "Find `Receiver Parameters -> Working Rate`."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:31
msgid "下拉选择 `10`。"
msgstr "Dropdown select `10`."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:32
msgid "点击 `Send to Chip` 保存配置。"
msgstr "Click `Send to Chip` to save the configuration."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:33
msgid "等待设备自动重启。"
msgstr "Waiting for the device to automatically restart."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:35
msgid "![Working Rate](../images/working-rate.png)"
msgstr "![Working Rate](../images/working-rate.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:35
msgid "Working Rate"
msgstr "Working Rate"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:37
msgid "配置当前固件的输出消息"
msgstr "Configure the output messages of the current firmware"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:39
msgid ""
"D20 地面版默认 10 Hz NMEA，无人机版默认 10 Hz UBX；D13 默认输出 10 Hz NMEA，"
"可按需求配置为 UBX。本页操作用于调整当前固件支持的消息项，不更改固件的用途配"
"置。"
msgstr ""
"The D20 ground firmware defaults to 10 Hz NMEA, and the UAV firmware "
"defaults to 10 Hz UBX. D13 defaults to 10 Hz NMEA and can be configured for "
"UBX on request. The settings on this page adjust messages supported by the "
"current firmware; they do not change the firmware profile."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:41
msgid ""
"如果外部设备只需要标准 NMEA，可在消息列表中只保留目标系统需要的语句。接入 "
"Viobot2 时建议至少开启 GGA 和 RMC。"
msgstr ""
"If the external device only requires standard NMEA, you can keep only the "
"sentences needed by the target system in the message list. It is recommended "
"to enable at least GGA and RMC when connecting Viobot2."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:43
msgid "配置路径："
msgstr "Configuration Path:"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:49
msgid ""
"在可输出的 NMEA 消息列表中勾选需要发送的语句，然后点击 `Send to Chip` 保存。"
msgstr ""
"Check the sentences you want to send from the list of outputtable NMEA "
"messages, and then click `Send to Chip` to save."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:51
msgid "![Output Message](../images/output-message.png)"
msgstr "![Output Message](../images/output-message.png)"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:51
msgid "Output Message"
msgstr "Output Message"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "配置完成判据"
msgstr "Configuration success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:56
msgid ""
"设备重启后持续输出目标协议，实际刷新率和消息项与配置一致，下游设备能够正常解"
"析。"
msgstr ""
"After the device restarts, it continuously outputs the target protocol, with "
"the actual refresh rate and message items consistent with the configuration, "
"and the downstream device can parse it normally."

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:59
msgid "配置建议"
msgstr "Configuration Recommendations"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "场景"
msgstr "Scene"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "建议"
msgstr "Suggestion"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "PC 调试"
msgstr "PC debugging"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "先保留当前固件的常用协议输出，便于观察状态"
msgstr ""
"First retain the common protocol outputs of the current firmware to "
"facilitate status observation"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "D20 飞控接入"
msgstr "D20 Flight Control Access"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "按飞控要求配置 UBX 输出；D20 无人机版默认 10 Hz"
msgstr ""
"Configure UBX output according to flight control requirements; D20 UAV "
"firmware defaults to 10 Hz"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "Viobot2 接入"
msgstr "Viobot2 Integration"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "至少开启 GGA 和 RMC；地面版默认 10 Hz，RTK 最高 10 Hz"
msgstr ""
"At least enable GGA and RMC; the ground firmware defaults to 10 Hz, RTK up "
"to 10 Hz"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "日志排查"
msgstr "Log troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/rtk/maintenance/parameters.md:53
msgid "保留原始协议日志，记录固件版本、串口参数和输出频率"
msgstr ""
"Keep the original protocol log, recording the firmware version, serial port "
"parameters, and output frequency"
